Dear {!$Record.Name},
Warm Greetings from Panchshil!

This is a friendly reminder that your Franking process has been completed, but the registration is still pending for your unit at {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}.

 Franking Details:
•	Customer Name: {!$Record.Name}
•	Project Name: {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}
•	Unit Number: {!$Record.EYI_Inventory__c}
•	Franking Completion Date: {!$Record.EYI_Franking_Received_Date__c}

To avoid any last-minute delays, we recommend proceeding with the registration at the earliest.

Thank you once again for choosing Panchshil. Please do not hesitate to reach out to us should you have any further queries or require additional assistance.

Best Regards,
Panchshil Realty

Dear {!$Record.Name},
Warm Greetings from Panchshil!

We are pleased to inform you that the Franking process for your unit at {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name} has been successfully completed.

Franking Details:
•	Customer Name: {!$Record.Name}
•	Project Name: {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}
•	Unit Number: {!$Record.EYI_Inventory__r.Name}
•	Franking Completion Date: {!$Record.EYI_Franking_Received_Date__c}

As the next step, we request you to initiate the registration process at the earliest to ensure a smooth and timely completion.

Thank you once again for choosing Panchshil. Please do not hesitate to reach out to us should you have any further queries or require additional assistance.

Best Regards,
Panchshil Realty

