Dear {!$Record.Name},
Warm Greetings from Panchshil!

We are delighted to inform you that the registration for your property at {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name} has been successfully completed!

 Registration Details:
•	Customer Name: {!$Record.Name}
•	Project Name: {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}
•	Unit Number: {!$Record.EYI_Inventory__r.Name}
